			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Remove final local re-exports from Air, Cache, and Vine modules\n\nDelete the remaining wrapper modules in Source/Air/mod.rs, Source/Cache/mod.rs, Source/Vine/Client.rs, Source/Vine/mod.rs, and Source/Vine/Server/Notification/Support/mod.rs that re-exported canonical implementations. Update Source/IPC/WindAirCommands/AirClientWrapper.rs and GetOrCreateAirClient.rs to import `::AirLibrary::Client::AirClient::AirClient` directly instead of via `crate::Air::AirClient`.\n\nAdjust Source/Vine/Server/Initialize.rs to use absolute paths for `::Vine::Error::VineError` and `::Vine::Generated` types. Remove the deprecated `Error` and `Multiplexer` module declarations from Source/Vine/mod.rs.\n\nThis completes the absolute-path migration, ensuring all Air, Cache, and Vine usage delegates to the canonical library crates with zero local re-export indirection.",
